  "synopsis": "In the mysterious realm of the Cat Planet, cats of diverse forms roam, and amidst them prowls a lonely Fire Cat. A twist of fate unfolds when a Water Cat materializes one day, sparking a fleeting camaraderie that tragically results in the inadvertent vaporization of the Water Cat by the heat of flames. The crestfallen Fire Cat, therefore, endeavors to reclaim the essence of the Water Cat and embarks on a brave journey…\n\n(Source: Tokyo Anime Award Festival)",
